    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halved is a roguelike action RPG game with only 5 levels but with endless possibilities in terms of item build. Play as one of 5 characters and traverse the dangerous parts of the world with the help of the mysterious <i>Father</i> against his rebel/tyrant son, <i>S.A.N.E.D.</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful items and stack them to infinity, before converting them to raw superpower with the help of the <i>Father</i> and unleashing it upon unsuspecting foes. Discover a unique ending with a certain character right after obliterating the final boss with potential godlike power.</p>",
